  "description": "Initial civic org chart for the Syntropia greenfield smart city, seeded as real Department organizations (policy, fund, permissions, Position seats, staff invite codes) by init.py. Founders bootstrap these before opening citizenship. Policies start founder-friendly (1/1) because a fresh realm has a single member; each department declares a target_policy (5-of-10) that admins ratchet up in Departments once the seats are staffed. Position salary_amount is per salary_period in the realm's accounting currency. Each department may declare 'extensions' (domain extensions its staff can access, seeded as Extension→department grants) and 'hidden_extensions' (sidebar hide rules via MenuDepartmentVisibility, visible=False); both are templates that admins can override later in Department Management.",
